{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15467","headline":"夜投丰德寺谒海上人 · 李端","name":"夜投丰德寺谒海上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半夜中峰有磬声，偶寻樵者问山名。\n上方月晓闻僧语，下界林疎见客行。\n野鹤巢边松最老，毒龙潜处水偏清。\n愿得远山知姓字，焚香洗鉢过余生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15467.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15467","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}